 "かたち": "صُورَة, شَكْل (To do with shape.) / اِسْتِمَارَة (A blank document or template to be filled in by the user.) / شَكَّلَ (To give (a shape or visible structure) to a thing or person.)  [(physical) form]\nمثال: 物質は温度によって形を変える。\n→ Matter changes its form according to temperature. / مَلَامِح, سِحْنَة (Countenance; one's face.)  [visage]\nocc. written 貌\nمثال: 神は自分の形に人を創造された。\n→ God created man in his own image. / صُورَة, شَكْل (To do with shape.) / اِسْتِمَارَة (A blank document or template to be filled in by the user.) / شَكَّلَ (To give (a shape or visible structure) to a thing or person.)  [form (as opposed to substance)]\nمثال: 自然は、環境面での危険に対しては他の形の防御を与えている。\n→ Nature provides other forms of protection against environmental dangers. / وَضْع (A condition; a set of circumstances applying at any given time.) / دَوْلَة (A polity or community.) / وِلَايَة (A polity or community.) / يُبْدِي (To make known.)  [(resultant) state]\nمثال: 地方の党員たちは自党に有利な形の選挙区割りをもくろんでいます。\n→ Local party members are trying to gerrymander the district.",
