 "かぶる": "لَبِسَ, اِرْتَدَى (To don (clothing, equipment, or the like).)  [to put on (one's head)]\nمثال: 「白い帽子をかぶっている男の人は誰ですか」と私は彼女に言った。\n→ I asked her who the man wearing the white hat was. / [to be covered with (dust, snow, etc.) ; to pour (water, etc.) on oneself]\nمثال: その機械はほこりをかぶっていた。\n→ The machine was coated with dust. / دُبّ (large mammal of family Ursidae) / دُبَّة (large mammal of family Ursidae) / اِحْتَمَلَ (To support, sustain, or endure.)  [to bear (e.g. someone's debts, faults, etc.)]\nمثال: 避難民は食料や水、薬などその他いろいろ不足を被るものだ。\n→ Refugees will suffer lack of food, water, medicine and all that. / [to overlap (e.g. sound or color)]",
