 "かみさま": "رَبّ (A person in a very high position of authority, importance or influence; a powerf)  [God]\nمثال: 危険が過ぎると神様は忘れられる。\n→ The danger past and God forgotten. / آس (A playing card showing a single pip, typically the highest or lowest ranking car) / واحد النرد, آس (A die face marked with a single dot, typically representing the number one.) / ذَرَّة (A very small quantity or degree; a particle; an atom; a jot.) / إرسال ساحق (A serve won without the opponent hitting the ball.) / أفضل رامٍ في الفريق (The best pitcher on the team.) / آس, آس (An expert at something; a maverick, genius; a person of supreme talent.)  [ace]",
 "かみさん": "زَوْجَة, اِمْرَأَة (The female of a pair of mated animals.)  [(one's) wife]\nمثال: うちのかみさんは元プロレスラーで、だからもし私が浮気をしているところを見つかりでもしようものなら、それこそコテンパンにやられてしまうよ。\n→ My wife used to be a pro-wrestler, so if she ever catches me two-timing her, I'd be beaten to a pulp. / زَوْجَة, اِمْرَأَة (The female of a pair of mated animals.)  [(someone's) wife] / [landlady]\nمثال: あの詐欺師と金髪のコールガールは下宿のおかみさんを怒らせるには申分のない取り合わせだ。\n→ The confidence man and his blonde call girl make a perfect match in enraging his landlady.",
