 "かろい": "إِشَارَة مُرُور, إِشَارَة ضَوْئِيَّة (A source of illumination.) / نُور, ضَوْء (A flame or something used to create fire.) / أَشْعَلَ, أَوْقَدَ (To start (a fire).) / أَضَاءَ (To illuminate; to provide light for when it is dark.) / مُنِير (Having light; bright; clear; not dark or obscure.) / فَاتِح (Pale or whitish in color; highly luminous and more or less deficient in chroma.) / خَفِيف (of low weight) / خفيف (of low weight) / خفيف (of low weight)  [light (i.e. not heavy)]\nمثال: えりのスーツケースは重たそうだが、実際はとても軽い。\n→ Although Eri's suitcase looks heavy, it's actually very light. / إِشَارَة مُرُور, إِشَارَة ضَوْئِيَّة (A source of illumination.) / نُور, ضَوْء (A flame or something used to create fire.) / أَشْعَلَ, أَوْقَدَ (To start (a fire).) / أَضَاءَ (To illuminate; to provide light for when it is dark.) / مُنِير (Having light; bright; clear; not dark or obscure.) / فَاتِح (Pale or whitish in color; highly luminous and more or less deficient in chroma.) / خَفِيف (of low weight) / خفيف (of low weight) / خفيف (of low weight)  [light (i.e. of foot)]\nمثال: 終わったあとも足が軽い感じがしました。\n→ I felt very light on my feet afterwards. / تافِه (Ignorable; of little significance or value.)  [trivial]\nمثال: しかし彼に大きなけがはなく、軽い打撲傷で済んだ。\n→ However he wasn't seriously hurt and got away with light bruising. / طَفِيف (small in amount, insignificant)  [slight]\nمثال: 私は軽く肩を触れられるのを感じた。\n→ I felt a light touch on my shoulder.",
 "かろう": "سُلَالَة (Race; lineage, pedigree.)  [strain]\nمثال: 彼女は過労でくたくたになっていた。\n→ She was worn out from overwork.",
