 "かろやか": "إِشَارَة مُرُور, إِشَارَة ضَوْئِيَّة (A source of illumination.) / نُور, ضَوْء (A flame or something used to create fire.) / أَشْعَلَ, أَوْقَدَ (To start (a fire).) / أَضَاءَ (To illuminate; to provide light for when it is dark.) / مُنِير (Having light; bright; clear; not dark or obscure.) / فَاتِح (Pale or whitish in color; highly luminous and more or less deficient in chroma.) / خَفِيف (of low weight) / خفيف (of low weight) / خفيف (of low weight)  [light]\nمثال: 彼女の足取りは妖精のように軽やかだった。\n→ Her footsteps were as light as a fairy's.",
